ordial?p=230952#post230952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We always try to do something a little different with each game, and Beast is the exception that highlights the rule - it's built to support crossovers, to the extent of having some powers based on interacting with other supernatural beings.<br /> <br /> Except Hunters, because fuck Gaston.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Noooo oooooooneeeeeee...<br /> <br /> Gets fucked like Gaston!<br /> Is shit out of luck like Gaston!<br /> Gets his body hidden on a long haul truck like Gaston!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T21:38:32-07:00","id":231002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=230972#post230972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Noooo oooooooneeeeeee...<br /> <br /> Gets fucked like Gaston!<br /> Is shit out of luck like Gaston!<br /> Gets his body hidden on a long haul truck like Gaston!</div> </div> </div> </div>As a monster splat, Hunters aren't cooperating!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3708-amateur-hour","name":"Amateur Hour","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T21:51:51-07:00","id":231013,"title":"","content":"I kind of just have this image of the sleezy, kinda fat monster mobster in an ostentatious suit, greeting people at the door(With his left hand, it might be indecent but it's better than what he does with his right), welcoming them to his lair, mixing murk and class(and oddly <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4sZlyOc58k\" target=\"_blank\">having something like this playing low in the background</a>), letting them enjoy themselves, relax, kick up their feet and have a cigar. Once everyone arrives to the party, he straightens the cardboard &quot;NO HUMANS ALLOWED!!&quot; sign on the door(He has a sense of humor, our host), before closing it and selling his pitch. By the time the night's over, about three quarters will go on with it, even if about a third of that will feel queasy. As for the final quarter...well, he can handle that later when his right hand gets itchy.<br /> <br /> It's obviously a caricature of what I think OP is going for, but it's got a sick sort of appeal to it.<br /> <br /> And the primordial aspect makes more sense-cosmologists beware.<br /> <br /> ...Wait, are we playing dinosaurs? Is this a big build up to the Super Mario Bros. Movie's alternate dimension delivered with cool?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"use