include Darkness as a medium.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Fear of the Unknown</b>: This Archetype rampages across the Digital Web every time Onyx Path announces a new game line. The best defense against this Archetype is to simply ignore it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T18:55:06-07:00","id":254928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=254863#post254863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We didn't pattern either the x- or y-axis splat after D&amp;D classes. Don't fret. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I knew that going in. I'm trying to go by themes, since, well, themes-that-are-also-kind-of-like-classes are kind of the thing with birth splats.<br /> <br /> And I don't really see why Fear of the Dark is not the same as Fear of the Unknown. The dark is feared precisely because it is unknown.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T19:21:25-07:00","id":254941,"title":"","content":"!<br /> <br /> Can I play the <a href=\"http://alanwake.wikia.com/wiki/The_Dark_Presence\" target=\"_blank\">Dark Presence</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T07:29:10-07:00","id":255277,"title":"","content":"As long as I can &quot;Attack the Darkness&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We don't just borrow words; on occasion, English has pursued other languages down alleyways to beat them unconscious and rifle their pockets for new vocabulary. - James. D. Nicoll</span></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","name":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T16:53:33-07:00","id":255663,"title":"","content":"Well, I choose Bigby Wolf. Because swag <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EfvYHUWuq9k\" data-code=\"EfvYHUWuq9k\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/EfvYHUWuq9k/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 09-12-2014, 07:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T17:15:33-07:00","id":255670,"title":"","content":"Raistlin, not to put a damper on your spirits here but...wouldn't Bigby be a werewolf or a Beast Changeling? I mean, I guess he's in at least one Beast's Family...<br /> <br /> Good link by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T06:45:03-07:00","id":256003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=255670#post255670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Raistlin, not to put a damper on your spirits here but...wouldn't Bigby be a werewolf or a Beast Changeling? I mean, I guess he's in at least one Beast's Family...<br /> <br /> Good link by the way.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I expect that's a question that'll come up frequently: &quot;Wouldn't this concept work as a [THIS] or a [THAT]?&quot; But that's already true in a lot of cases, as evidenced by the fact that we've got overlap between werewolves and Beast Seeming changelings. <br /> <br /> And, honestly, blurred those lines a little is deliberate, here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T07:09:10-07:00","id":256019,"title":"","content":"In those terms, Bigby wouldn\u00b4t even fit as a changeling. If anything, he would be more like a Charlatan (Banished).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 09-13-2014, 12:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T09:36:19-07:00","id":256103,"title":"","content":"I imagine given the idea that Beasts are related to everyone leads to a lot of overlapping images.<br /> <br /> I mean, based on what little we know, every character concept I've had could fit in another game line without blinking. Which is rather the point, maybe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T16:48:14-07:00","id":256358,"title":"","content":"I wonder how close those the lines blur.<br /> Vampire: I am a true vampire.<br /> Vampire Like Beast: Oh, that's cute.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T19:21:25-07:00","id":256426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>UnjustCustos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=256358#post256358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder how close those the lines blur.<br /> Vampire: I am a true vampire.<br /> Vampire Like Beast: <b>*spits out a bit of heart*</b> Oh, that's cute.</div> </div> </div> </div> I imagine it's like that sort of difference.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T17:02:18-07:00","id":256884,"title":"","content":"Take it from here James.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOQ-yvZt0pY\" data-code=\"JOQ-yvZt0pY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/JOQ-yvZt0pY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1uaacLVF8Nw\" data-code=\"1uaacLVF8Nw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/1uaacLVF8Nw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T19:25:33-07:00","id":256953,"title":"","content":"What about Beast says Jekyll and Hyde? It keeps popping up, but once again I'm getting that feeling of projected hopes and dreams without basis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T19:57:17-07:00","id":256958,"title":"","content":"From the Labor Day post.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">The remaining \u201cclassic\u201d monsters were also getting a bit thin, with Creature of the Black Lagoon or Mr Hyde or Invisible Man ideas floating around, but not sticking. </span></span><b>Beast\u2019s</b><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> pitch brings a lot of those ideas together, and looks at the dark underpinnings of those stories and says: \u201cPlay that!\u201d</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> We've also been told that a dragon like Beast won't be transforming into a winged serpentine creature, but able to evoke the same fears that a dragon might, and that there won't be anything like a customizable Beast Form because that's too close to Demon. With these in mind I think the Beast is going to be more human in appearance, but capable of some immense brutality. Hyde goes into some of the fears of other people, of their cruelty. It even goes into the fear that we might be just as bad. I don't think that the whole line will be Dr. Jekyll an Mr. Hyde the game, but that's kind of the point, it seems. Beasts aren't going to be a singular class of entity, but close families of the monstrous and horrific.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T23:33:40-07:00","id":257014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AutoDefenestrate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=256958#post256958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From the Labor Day post.<br /> [/FONT][/COLOR][/SIZE]<br /> <br /> We've also been told that a dragon like Beast won't be transforming into a winged serpentine creature, but able to evoke the same fears that a dragon might, and that there won't be anything like a customizable Beast Form because that's too close to Demon. With these in mind I think the Beast is going to be more human in appearance, but capable of some immense brutality. Hyde goes into some of the fears of other people, of their cruelty. It even goes into the fear that we might be just as bad. I don't think that the whole line will be Dr. Jekyll an Mr. Hyde the game, but that's kind of the point, it seems. Beasts aren't going to be a singular class of entity, but close families of the monstrous and horrific.</div> </div> </div> </div>They might not have a customizable form, but there may be a power for a Gauru-esque form, or one like the Lucifuge's demon form power. Not as customizable, but something to beast out, if you will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u><b>My Homebrew</b></u><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PLu_eTg03h4ogiTSGSkzEB7T_1YpB9_VkhHmgZN41-I/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Star Wars d10</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">T</a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">he Fallen for Demon: the Descent</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-TDr4NF_5cUn-In2vjI9P5LTKqsu9B4-OMxbnbaTgT8/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Requiem for a Masquerade: VtR 2e Cainite Conversion</a> (<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpKi5giBNsQrZRLIRRjaCe7sHVm1Q13ravVYlE45Dbw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Vampira Roma</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1601-dreaminggod","name":"Dreaminggod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"745"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T00:57:27-07:00","id":257037,"title":"","content":"Could be, too much is speculation at this point, but I tend to find the more human monsters to be more frightening. If the game is about fears, it could be an avenue to go down. I admit I'm somewhat chomping at the bit for more information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T06:58:57-07:00","id":257250,"title":"","content":"I'm my sound crazy, but with Astral Realm as &quot;their&quot; and this blurb:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;Within every one of us lies the potential of the Beast. Unleash savage powers, answer the call to your Lair, and become the thing that Heroes fear. </div> </div> </div>What if Lair is deep, horrific Astral Domain that &quot;calls&quot; to people, overtake they body for some time, making this Beast? You are astral-ridden slasher, basiclly, and Heroes are antagonists hunting for you in the myths you are created to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T12:36:17-07:00","id":257513,"title":"","content":"I did wonder if Beasts were just sort of a template super-imposed onto the other splats, but I don't think they would present that as a new game-line - a crazy cool blue book maybe, but not its own game. And even if it is the 'Crossover Game' I don't think they'd be so blatant as saying they're all about Mage's Astral.<br /> <br /> Sorry, just sounds like another 'Mage Cosmology Wins' theory","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T12:53:44-07:00","id":257523,"title":"","content":"<i>The Mages are right about evveeeerythiiiing.</i><br /> <br /> There's a horror story in there somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T13:56:38-07:00","id":257588,"title":"","content":"That horror story isn't exactly hidden, it's quite a good one too.<br /> <br /> Arcanthus: &quot;My friends, my family, my job, they were all holding me back and trapping me in routine, so I sacrafied them all for power&quot;. A bit of an exageration, an typical Arcanthus sacrafices friendship, not the actual friends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T14:02:33-07:00","id":257591,"title":"","content":"I think you missed the point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T20:40:28-07:00","id":257821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>UnjustCustos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=256358#post256358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder how close those the lines blur.<br /> Vampire: I am a true vampire.<br /> Vampire Like Beast: Oh, that's cute.</div> </div> </div> </div>But what if the Beast is really the Beast which is simply the same flavor of the Beast so when talk about Beast, we are really talking about the same Beast in the same both games.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T22:39:08-07:00","id":257897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=257821#post257821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But what if the Beast is really the Beast which is simply the same flavor of the Beast so when talk about Beast, we are really talking about the same Beast in the same both games.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no, I've gone cross-eyed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T23:12:12-07:00","id":257908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>UnjustCustos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=257897#post257897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh no, I've gone cross-eyed.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_5aL9rNTt8&amp;t=16\" data-code=\"0_5aL9rNTt8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/0_5aL9rNTt8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T07:47:45-07:00","id":258144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=257513#post257513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I did wonder if Beasts were just sort of a template super-imposed onto the other splats, but I don't think they would present that as a new game-line - a crazy cool blue book maybe, but not its own game. And even if it is the 'Crossover Game' I don't think they'd be so blatant as saying they're all about Mage's Astral.<br /> <br /> Sorry, just sounds like another 'Mage Cosmology Wins' theory</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, the only idea I'd like see die a death - on both sides of any such argument - is the one that Mage somehow wins if something like this happens. What it would actually mean is that the Astral would stop being Mage's exclusive cosmology just like the Hisil did Werewolf's.<br /> <br /> That aside, we have seen talk of how the monstrous soul of the Beast ravages the local dreamscape, that being what calls up Heroes - and in the dreamscape, the soul <i>can</i> look like a big greeblous monster. And I suspect that we'll get advice on how to relate this dreamscape to both the Astral and the Skein, but neither of them sound like they quite fit what Beast's will be like - that it's a <i>local</i> dreamscape doesn't sound like the Astral, which doesn't map onto physical geography - that it's a dream<i>scape</i> doesn't sound like the Skein, which is made up of strings of individual dreams. So I'm going to guess it will be something else, but easily connectable to those things - and probably to the Hisil and Hedge as well.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T07:11:16-07:00","id":258956,"title":"","content":"Hmm...&quot;dreamscape...&quot; But what created the dreamscape?<br /> <br /> I don't remember if Nyx was mentioned in this thread. As the primordial goddess of the night that even Zeus feared I think she deserves a mention. She gave birth to much that mankind feared (e.g. Death, Old Age), but also that which mankind felt safe in (e.g.. Daylight). And without fear courage doesn't exist. She also gave birth to Sleep (Hypnos), and dreams.<br /> <br /> This is the immaterial component. <br /> <br /> The more material would focus on Gaia, who gave birth to a lot of monsters as well as gods.<br /> <br /> Two great mother goddesses. Often painted as indifferent to their children. Contrary to observation of how protective mothers the world over tend to treat their children. Sure, children leave home, but I think mom keeps their bedroom just the way they left it in case they visit.<br /> <br /> Of course this turns away from the Nightbreed/tribe of monsters scenario going on...so, we adapt.<br /> <br /> Hmmm Nightbreed...Clive Barker's Cabal...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T09:27:39-07:00","id":259011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=258956#post258956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm...&quot;dreamscape...&quot; But what created the dreamscape?<br /> <br /> I don't remember if Nyx was mentioned in this thread. As the primordial goddess of the night that even Zeus feared I think she deserves a mention. She gave birth to much that mankind feared (e.g. Death, Old Age), but also that which mankind felt safe in (e.g.. Daylight). And without fear courage doesn't exist. She also gave birth to Sleep (Hypnos), and dreams.<br /> <br /> This is the immaterial component.<br /> <br /> The more material would focus on Gaia, who gave birth to a lot of monsters as well as gods.<br /> <br /> Two great mother goddesses. Often painted as indifferent to their children. Contrary to observation of how protective mothers the world over tend to treat their children. Sure, children leave home, but I think mom keeps their bedroom just the way they left it in case they visit.<br /> <br /> Of course this turns away from the Nightbreed/tribe of monsters scenario going on...so, we adapt.<br /> <br /> Hmmm Nightbreed...Clive Barker's Cabal...</div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually thinking along this line myself.<br /> <br /> My guess is that, again, they believe the Primordial gave humans the ability to evolve into more and less than they were. I've also got the idea that most Beasts around the Western and Japanese cultures tend to view Her as female, because the mother of monsters is a figure in the myths of both cultural backgrounds. Lilith and Izanami come to mind. The mother of those who defy the divine order by defying it herself, whether what God made her in particular for, or the division between the living and the dead. There are probably male examples, but the idea of the creator of monsters being female is an extremely common idea in dominant modern cultures.<br /> <br /> In this, the Primordial shows her kindness; humans need their monsters. Otherwise, how would they know what is human, if they did not have the inhuman?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T09:49:52-07:00","id":259020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=259011#post259011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In this, the Primordial shows her kindness; humans need their monsters. Otherwise, how would they know what is human, if they did not have the inhuman?</div> </div> </div> </div>oooh...take that further. Because she'd have to know what being human means as well, no?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T11:47:53-07:00","id":259086,"title":"","content":"Is Mother of Monster officially stated as part of the game, or just fans wild guess?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T15:44:19-07:00","id":259314,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure that most of what's going on in this thread is guesswork, wondering, and wishing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/