/></div> </div> </div> </div>Would finally beat my favorite stereotype of the Tremere by the Brujah. I can't remember the exact words as my books are all now ash but it was along the lines of &quot;Imagine you took a bunch of DnD nerds and told them their powers were real&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T15:35:14-07:00","id":264191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=263040#post263040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good point. Though it would amuse me to see &quot;Fuck Gaston&quot; as a Hunter stereotype.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Alternatives:<br /> <br /> &quot;Beowulf is a loser and he's my bitch.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Would you leave a monster-man alone?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I guess we're not angels to you, huh?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You're certainly no Marduk. In fact, you wouldn't even rate as a Bellerophon.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T15:48:26-07:00","id":264203,"title":"","content":"I can even imagine a slightly more positive spin on hunters than on Heroes.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not sure what's worse; that you're just as lethal as Monsieur Gaston over there, or that you decided to become him in perfect control of your wits.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T21:44:40-07:00","id":264383,"title":"","content":"I wonder what X-Splat 2 thinks of Kindred","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T07:53:07-07:00","id":264606,"title":"","content":"&quot;You're leaving out the best parts&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T08:24:00-07:00","id":264621,"title":"","content":"Now I wanna play this JUST to come up with lines to mock the &quot;heroes&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;Seriously, you went the Ripley route? At least she had a mecha! All you've got is a flamethrower......and I'm a salamander, sweetheart!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh look, another Theseus wannabe. Yeah, I found the kite string about 100 feet back......have fun following it back.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If I have to pick one more St George clone out of my teeth, I'm gonna throw up the last three of them in disgust.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Will you look at this shit, Dave!?! Someone actually paid attention during Evil Dead II! How much more gas do you think he has in that?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T08:32:19-07:00","id":264623,"title":"","co