y safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T10:33:23-07:00","id":264673,"title":"","content":"Yeah. What an asshole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T10:50:15-07:00","id":264679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=264673#post264673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. What an asshole.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're a monster, yeah! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T20:32:53-07:00","id":265138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=264673#post264673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. What an asshole.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026You've managed to knock together a couple elements that I did not expect my brain to latch onto, but I find myself lacking the requisite free time to make a Saint George parody of the lyrics of &quot;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VuJTqmpBnI0\" target=\"_blank\">[No One Verbs Like] Gaston.</a>&quot;<br /> <br /> And now it's in <i>your </i>head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T05:54:00-07:00","id":265380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=264621#post264621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I wanna play this JUST to come up with lines to mock the &quot;heroes&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;Seriously, you went the Ripley route? At least she had a mecha! All you've got is a flamethrower......and I'm a salamander...<b><i>bitch</i></b>!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>fixed.<br /> <br /> ...What do you mean THEY shut off the power? How can they shut off the power, man, they're ANIMALS?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T07:25:03-07:00","id":265438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=265138#post265138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026You've managed to knock together a couple elements that I did not expect my brain to latch onto, but I find myself lacking the requisite free time to make a Saint George parody of the lyrics of &quot;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VuJTqmpBnI0\" target=\"_blank\">[No One Verbs Like] Gaston.</a>&quot;<br /> <br /> And now it's in <i>your </i>head.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll get you started....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> No one slays like Saint George<br /> Or beheads like Saint George,<br /> Or stands up to the Emperor like Saint George!<br /> He's especially good at EXAGGERATING!<br /> OH, what a guy, that Saint George! </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T23:29:08-07:00","id":265995,"title":"","content":"Given that the Kindred, Uratha, and Awakened were always shown as possible frenemies in almost every game line in the WoD, I feel that it would be a wasted opportunity if there was an X-splat dedicated to them, given that Beasts seem to focus on the metaphysical fears. Mages would be the most vulnerable here because they are still Human. And the Kindred would also be affected similarly because of their slim ties to said Humanity.<br /> <br /> That's why I thought the Strix was a Beast type focused on the Kindred of the World of Darkness. They hit many of the prequisites stated in the podcast, despite the &quot;Human&quot; aspect of it. And their main point of satisfying themselves is to cause chaos among the Kindred and to completely destroy the Masquerade, causing a global recognition of vampire existence. As for the Hero portion, it wasn't stated that the Hero HAS to be Human. In Blood and Smoke, the Khaibit would fit the role of Hero, as they are best equipped to handle the Strix.<br /> <br /> I know that it's too early to tell the actual synopsis, but again it would be a missed opportunity to not include the supernatural community as possible allies/victims of Beasts.<br /> <br /> Hopefully this will be answered in the upcoming spoiler blog.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T07:57:22-07:00","id":266145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=265995#post265995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that the Kindred, Uratha, and Awakened were always shown as possible frenemies in almost every game line in the WoD, I feel that it would be a wasted opportunity if there was an X-splat dedicated to them, given that Beasts seem to focus on the metaphysical fears. Mages would be the most vulnerable here because they are still Human. And the Kindred would also be affected similarly because of their slim ties to said Humanity.<br /> <br /> That's why I thought the Strix was a Beast type focused on the Kindred of the World of Darkness. They hit many of the prequisites stated in the podcast, despite the &quot;Human&quot; aspect of it. And their main point of satisfying themselves is to cause chaos among the Kindred and to completely destroy the Masquerade, causing a global recognition of vampire existence. As for the Hero portion, it wasn't stated that the Hero HAS to be Human. In Blood and Smoke, the Khaibit would fit the role of Hero, as they are best equipped to handle the Strix.<br /> <br /> I know that it's too early to tell the actual synopsis, but again it would be a missed opportunity to not include the supernatural community as possible allies/victims of Beasts.<br /> <br /> Hopefully this will be answered in the upcoming spoiler blog.</div> </div> </div> </div>1)No one said anything about basing the X-splats off of the other splats, simply that each one could cover a stereotype of Promethean through Demon and no one would be left out, 'cept hunters. Borrowing Lel's thing, it could be that Predation talks about Promethean, Darkness talks about Changelings, Isolation talks about Sin-Eaters, Nature talks about Mummies, and Entropy talks about Demons, and all of them talk about the Big Three.<br /> <br /> 2)This is not a wholly accurate response to mages, but I'm just gonna go ahead and laugh and say &quot;Oh that's rich,mages are human, that's hilarious&quot;. It doesn't take physiological changes to become a monster, and mages are still prone to losing their biological humanity anyways.<br /> <br /> 3)I imagine that when Matt says this is crossover friendly, he means it's crossover friendly-in other words, Beasts make allies/victims of the supernatural community.<br /> <br /> I've heard rumors of wa-playtests, so who knows what we might hear soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T10:12:43-07:00","id":266273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=266145#post266145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1)No one said anything about basing the X-splats off of the other splats, simply that each one could cover a stereotype of Promethean through Demon and no one would be left out, 'cept hunters. Borrowing Lel's thing, it could be that Predation talks about Promethean, Darkness talks about Changelings, Isolation talks about Sin-Eaters, Nature talks about Mummies, and Entropy talks about Demons, and all of them talk about the Big Three.<br /> <br /> 2)This is not a wholly accurate response to mages, but I'm just gonna go ahead and laugh and say &quot;Oh that's rich,mages are human, that's hilarious&quot;. It doesn't take physiological changes to become a monster, and mages are still prone to losing their biological humanity anyways.<br /> <br /> 3)I imagine that when Matt says this is crossover friendly, he means it's crossover friendly-in other words, Beasts make allies/victims of the supernatural community.<br /> <br /> I've heard rumors of wa-playtests, so who knows what we might hear soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. I didn't say that the X-splats will be solely based on the other supernaturals. I'm just saying that it would be a &quot;missed opportunity&quot; for the developers to NOT do something special for at least the Kindred, Uratha, and Awakened of the World of Darkness because those three splats are just as numerous as humans (in some cases). If you want to add in the other splats, even though their membership is sorely diminished compared to the main three, then do as you will.<br /> <br /> 2. If you take a look at the book for Mage:The Awakening, you would see that they actually state that Mages are still Human, despite being shoved into a supernatural template. Ask the developers. Mages would still have the same fears that vanilla Mortals have. The only difference is that they have a supernatural way of defending themselves. While it's true that Mages have to be careful about losing themselves to Hubris, it's more psychological that physiological. They don't gradually lose there human form.<br /> <br /> 3. I know it's crossover friendly. I'm just saying that the developers shouldn't pass over the chance of Beasts satisfying the Hunger on the supernatural community as well as they will on the Mortals. From what I've heard on this thread, it seemed to be headed to a &quot;once you are no longer human, then Beasts will no longer satisfy their Hunger&quot; mentality. I felt that this would be a shame.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T12:04:34-07:00","id":266356,"title":"","content":"I have no idea what you're even getting at anymore.<br /> <br /> Well, okay, I get what you're saying on two, but that's a long philosophical debate for another forum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T17:04:43-07:00","id":266515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"ht