://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T08:09:53-07:00","id":266764,"title":"","content":"So, I've got a bunch of the first drafts in, including Travis Stout's first draft of [powerz]. One of said powers is called &quot;All Your Teeth Are Falling Out.&quot; <br /> <br /> I'm really, really, looking forward to digging into this, but I want to a) finish redlining <b>Promethean</b> first and b) I have a Kickstarter launching on Wednesday, so I need my ducks in a row. <br /> <br /> But once I start redlining <b>Beast</b>? Y'all should check my Twitter. I post little comments about bits of the book and so on. (It's @blackhat_matt). <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T08:16:27-07:00","id":266770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> One of said powers is called &quot;All Your Teeth Are Falling Out.&quot; </div> </div> </div>I can already tell this game is going to give me nightmares...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T08:57:18-07:00","id":266779,"title":"","content":"I am caught up with this thread now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> I think this idea is pretty cool... I like the thought of being able to choose a monster, think why it's scary and form a character around that... That you need to Hunt in order to stop Heroes rising up along with giving you the ability to be full and have a certain amount of power. I also like that there is a link to the other splats as Family and we have a splat coming in now that effectively is in opposition to Hunters, though I would say Hunters and Heroes are two different types of people... The Heroes call to mind for myself at least the Hunters of the oWoD, which were chosen by some power to rise up and fight the monsters...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T09:17:05-07:00","id":266786,"title":"","content":"hmmm....World of Darkness: The Bygone Bestiary (1998)<br /> <i> <b>Everyone Loves a Monster</b><br /> Break free from the shackles of humanity with a blast of dragon fire. Take flight with wings of bright feathers and leave the mundane world behind. Monsters are the products of imagination; they're not real or are they? Dreams take shape in the hidden places of the world, and beyond the Earth itself. Unicorns, dragons, goblins they're all too real. You just need to know where to find them.<br /> <b>Even If the Monster Is You</b><br /> Step beyond the Mists and enter the twilight world of the magical beast of the unicorn, the manticore, the witch-cat and the mermaid. Join the dance of the Dark Fantastic with The Bygone Bestiary, the source on monsters and supernatural creatures of the World of Darkness. Just because you cant see them doesn't mean they're not there and now you have the chance to play one.</i><br /> <br /> ---------------<br /> <br /> I can't help but think there's a relation. Perhaps taking it to the next level.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T09:19:22-07:00","id":266787,"title":"","content":"Sounds very similar to what Beast is going to be from what I've read...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T17:19:01-07:00","id":267076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt<