path.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T11:54:51-07:00","id":293981,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But I really don't like the attitude you've copped in the last page about the priority of your homebrew over the canon that the rest of us are talking about. </div> </div> </div>Yeah, sorry for the derail, though I more argued in mind of Gangrel than Beasts actually. I will stop until we maybe get really solid info public beta or something in that vein.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T12:02:02-07:00","id":293994,"title":"","content":"One thing I've been having difficulty with in relation to Beast is what to <i>picture</i> when I think about them. There was talk of Dragons and Beast (nee <i>Beauty and the</i>), but I understand that &quot;Turning into a dragon in Times Square isn't what we're going for&quot;.<br /> <br /> Can we get some inspirational media to check out? I imagine stuff like the movie