\"></div> Then I'd recommend against Werewolf </div> </div> </div>Matter of perspective. Urathra still small in comparison to a dragon or a manticore. Emphasis on giant. Even if Urathra 9 feet tall in their warforms.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T08:42:06-08:00","id":300029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Two-Shadows</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=299720#post299720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Trying to hard to be innovative and &quot;subversive&quot; as they put it.</div> </div> </div> </div>But we don't really even know what those are <i>really</i> referring to with the game. Isn't it a little early to write this off?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T09:30:14-08:00","id":300085,"title":"","content":"We do kind of know what they meant with &quot;subversive&quot; - they meant Beast subverts the traditional monster-slaying narrative, such as Grendel, rather than subverting any WoD tropes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T09:43:39-08:00","id":300121,"title":"","content":"That makes sense. That's pretty much how every splat works. Have to present the splats from the humanizing angle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T09:51:29-08:00","id":300136,"title":"","content":"Well, I hope humanizing angle will be there. I know my local folklore, and not all monsters of my region were black and white in presentation. Surely, people rightly feared a one here and dared not to go into woods, but if you got lost and yet showed respect to his domain or displayed other admirable quality in his eyes he was as likely to help stranded people. I'm totally up to play a Beast if we can play one that can have admirable qualities like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T11:53:49-08:00","id":300251,"title":"","content":"For me The big question of whether or not I'm getting this game is if I can become a beast or not. <br /> <br /> I find far to often with T.V. shows in particular that beast type monsters are little more than humans with powers. Supernatural, Grimm, and now Constantine all fall into this trap. ,obviously Budgets are an issue given their medium, but not ours. Dragons don't need a mile wing span, Giants don't need to be three stories tall. but monsters should be monsters.<br /> <br /> As for the suspension of disbelief it's all about how it's handled both in the books and on the table.<br /> The other issue that just popped into my head is the frame work of the world of darkness system is that all characters start with a vanilla human template their are obviously lots of ways to handle it but I'm curious how that specifically will turn out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","a