ve <i>any </i>idea how flippin' hard it is to amount a decent treasure hoard on <i>this economy</i>??Shit son,i'm gonna eat George Bush one of these days i swear to Echdina&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Hei,Larry you have grown man,oh don't recognize me?Remember that time when you wre 7 and your momma had left for a job emergency and you had to sleep all alone in your room and you almost ruined your pants because you were SO Sure something would jump out of the dark and eat you?Well,that was me! I didn't eat you sorry ass then because i don't like my meat that young, now that you are this big heap monster-hunter,well...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 12-27-2014, 11:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T22:15:50-08:00","id":352343,"title":"","content":"&quot;Look, we can sit here and perpetuate a cycle of pain, loss, and death that's been pissing around on the human condition and making everything a soggy, stench-ridden mess, or we can go grab coffee. Ball's in your court&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/