Ghoul, except both happens.</div> </div> </div> </div>I much prefer Parasyte, myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T18:58:15-08:00","id":353339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=352343#post352343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Look, we can sit here and perpetuate a cycle of pain, loss, and death that's been pissing around on the human condition and making everything a soggy, stench-ridden mess, or we can go grab coffee. Ball's in your court&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Or &quot;Sure, we can have this epic battle of order versus chaos. But have you thought this through? Even if you win I could hurt you. How good is your insurance? Did you know that medical bills are a leading cause of bankruptcy? And then there's the PTSD, that could go anywhere from no longer fun at parties to stay away from the smelly homeless guy whose ranting at thin air.<br /> <br /> How good are you at body disposal anyway? You didn't look up body disposal on your computer did you? Even if you leave the scene of the crime spotless, you'll be worried about the SWAT team busting down your door and shooting your dog. What's your defense going to be? I was a monster? You do know that pleas of non guilty because of insanity leave you in the land of electroshock therapy and padded rooms, right?<br /> <br /> So let's not and say we did, what do you say? We can go to the bar instead, first round on me. Pick up some ladies, I make a great wingman I'll have you know.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T20:24:01-08:00","id":353398,"title":"","content":"Even if Beasts and Heroes are vicious bastards, I'm personally inclined to breaking negative cycles. Besides, provoking the guy trying to kill me seems problematic.<br /> <br /> That said, I imagine that's not so easy an answer for Beasts, given their hunger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 12-28-2014, 11:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T22:15:27-08:00","id":353468,"title":"","content":"The thing about the heroes,is that they are the Bad Guys of the game for an reason:The &quot;Heroes&quot; are not righteous monster -unters who are trying to kill The Beasts beause they think the beast is a threat to innocent people,they just want to be the famous beast killer,,they want street cred &quot;Hey,i killed that thing!&quot; they don't care about why the beast does what she does,or why the beast is there in the first place,they Just want to kill it and get famous. The &quot;Heroes&quot; are not doing it for anyone but themselves,they are the epitome of being selfish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T22:53:15-08:00","id":353528,"title":"","content":"I imagine it isn't always so clear cut, and it's probably a two way street.<br /> <br /> I mean, if nothing else, player characters are rarely paragons of decency all the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T00:25:49-08:00","id":353546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=353468#post353468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing about the heroes,is that they are the Bad Guys of the game for an reason:The &quot;Heroes&quot; are not righteous monster -unters who are trying to kill The Beasts beause they think the beast is a threat to innocent people,they just want to be the famous beast killer,,they want street cred &quot;Hey,i killed that thing!&quot; they don't care about why the beast does what she does,or why the beast is there in the first place,they Just want to kill it and get famous. The &quot;Heroes&quot; are not doing it for anyone but themselves,they are the epitome of being selfish.</div> </div> </div> </div>True that,But i have the impression the impression the heroes will be more or less like the way just described cause that's the way matt said they were goign to be,or at least how it sounded to me","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T06:45:15-08:00","id":353674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=353339#post353339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Or &amp;quot;Sure, we can have this epic battle of order versus chaos. But have you thought this through? Even if you win I could hurt you. How good is your insurance? Did you know that medical bills are a leading cause of bankruptcy? And then there's the PTSD, that could go anywhere from no longer fun at parties to stay away from the smelly homeless guy whose ranting at thin air.<br /> <br /> How good are you at body disposal anyway? You didn't look up body disposal on your computer did you? Even if you leave the scene of the crime spotless, you'll be worried about the SWAT team busting down your door and shooting your dog. What's your defense going to be? I was a monster? You do know that pleas of non guilty because of insanity leave you in the land of electroshock therapy and padded rooms, right?<br /> <br /> So let's not and say we did, what do you say? We can go to the bar instead, first round on me. Pick up some ladies, I make a great wingman I'll have you know.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Or, perhaps what I think is the best of all:<br /> &quot;911?! Yeah, you've got to help me! Some madman just broke into my house, and he's got a chainsaw! He sprouting some sort of nonsense about monsters and bad dreams. Yeah, I'm at [Location]. Please, hurry!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T08:35:25-08:00","id":353763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=353546#post353546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True that,But i have the impression the impression the heroes will be more or less like the way just described cause that's the way matt said they were goign to be,or at least how it sounded to me</div> </div> </div> </div>Did...Did you just quote yourself?<br /> <br /> Missed something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join