 it wrong that I'd not be surprised if there is an anime that's already done something similar. Just hedging my bets on the likely hundreds of different magical girl animes that exist. If ArcaneArts reappears on this thread he maybe able to give us an example, is anime knowledge far surpasses my own.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Princess Tutu</i> might be what you're looking for though it's arguably a <i>Changeling</i> setting rather than <i>Princess </i>or <i>Beast</i>.<br /> <br /> <i>Nyarko-san: </i><i>Another Crawling Chaos</i> is Beasts as Magical Girls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 01-31-2015, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T16:17:34-08:00","id":387757,"title":"","content":"I'm still hoping the beasts are those from myth and fantasy. I've got certain things I'm writing about regarding a few individuals; Spike (female with unicorn animus); Griff (male with gryphon animus) and Frost (male with fire dragon animus). I'm thinking that they might fit well with Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Sha