edes and silver fish, they're everywhere, crawling on you, pecking at you with their pincers, you just can't seem to escape them... you run upstairs, nearly falling through the staircase only to discover that the rooms have collapsed under their own weight, falling through the first floor into the basement beneath and the pit that they have made is full of ever more garbage and insects... and oh god, they know your here...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=514422#post514422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't help but wonder what a Beast's lifespan is, if it is even <i>mortal</i> for that matter. I could certainly see an impossibly ancient Beast with a Lair that could be a whole country unto itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>If they're not immortal they'd better have an impossibly long lifespan (I want ancient swamp gods, dang it!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":256,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","user":"Gnomish American","date":".  Consolidation. 05-14-2015, 04:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value