lass=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also on another note. Beast character functionally have no Integrity system they can be as bad as they want.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm Reminded of the Dark Sun D&amp;D Campaign, Specifically the Part of Dying of Thirst &quot;Alignments are Momentarily Suspended until you are no-longer Dying of Thirst&quot; Basically a Beast is Always Hungry and the Hunger Dominates their actions. High Satiety and they can Regret it like anyone would, Low and they Don't Care. I Believe i said it before.... &quot;When their Full their human and That Sucks because you can Feel everything you've done and Regret it&quot;.<br /> <br /> Now.. How about Homebrewing/Making a Spell too Set a Beast at Satiety 10 temporarily? Or Even a Nightmare..... Hmm....<br /> <br /> Edit: Notice this is a Running theme with Characters with Hungers in NWoD.... When Hungry alot of them are Straight up... &quot;MUST FEED!&quot; i can Understand that abit. (Also not using this as an Excuse for Beasts, Just an Example) Also Makes Beasts abit more of &quot;Kin&quot; too Pandorians.....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":3981,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","user":"RickmanUK","date":". 06-07-2015, 03:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T12:00:02-07:00","id":544119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon