n see a reformed Hero turned Hunter keeping some of there abilities depending on how exactly it all goes down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T18:59:33-07:00","id":546300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>n_a_anyon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=545778#post545778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really am getting pissed off that people are saying this book endorses abuse.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not a hard attitude to understand, especially considering the number of people who have read it (myself included) and found that reading the material has been viscerally unpleasant and made unfortunate implications, regardless of how deliberate the authoring of the implications was.<br /> <br /> I've seen enough of the various OPP Authors' work and community interaction to know that they're definitively not doing that in any fashion, but divorced from interaction with the author of the text, it is not difficult to ascribe the motivations of the writers with