theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T18:49:46-07:00","id":553610,"title":"","content":"Like I said, I'm inclined to like the changes rather than dislike them, and certainly nothing has changed my desire to buy or to write for this game. It's not as sharp, but it is still rich, it is wider now, and it is more mature. The game I liked has just grown up a little, and that's never a bad thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T18:59:11-07:00","id":553619,"title":"","content":"I just read the revised intro. I'm feeling kind of... uneasy about it. Mostly, I don't like the channges very much; they feel a bit like they fell short of what they aimed for, or perhaps they merely fall shor of my expectations. I was very, very enthusiastic about the first draft, so perhaps, it's just a knee-jerk reation to seein something I liked change.<br /> Still I'll try to explain what bothers me with the revision:<br /> <br /> 1) The Devouring:<br /> -I dislike the fact that Beasts can just ask people to become one of them. I don't feel like iit mesh with the Legendary Monster theme. Dragons, Giants and Tentacled Abominations don't invite people to join the club.<br /> -It now really feels like the Beasts are possessed, or claimed, or whatever, as if the Horror is an alien invader replacing the person the Beast was before, and worse! they do it with the pre-Beast permission. That just feels like a suicide, and for no reason.<br /> -How does it work, really? Why does it need a Beast to have the future Begotten agree to it? What kind of monster wait for permssion before eating?<br /> <br /> 2) The Horror:<br /> -They sound too much like body-snatchers.<br /> - Are they ususally just floating around waiting for future Beasts?<br /> -It would be cool if they were the progeny and agents of the Dark Mother, or something, but no origin is given.<br /> <br /> 3)The teaching:<br /> -Why, in the name of Stephen King? Of all the things legendary monsters could have been tasked to do, why this? It forces Beasts to become abusers, catharsis or not, which was one of the things people disliked most about Beast even when they didn't actually have to scare or hurt people. <br /> -What exactly are those lessons Beast are supposed to teach?<br /> -It feels like it's trying to make Beasts into misunderstood antiheroes. For a moment I was scared they would glittter or something (Ok, not really, but come on).<br /> <br /> <br /> What I like:<br /> <br /> 1) Heroes:<br /> -They gain in depht, complexity and nuance. Not bad for such a short description!<br /> <br /> Mostly, though, I hope I'm reading most of those changes wrong. I'll perhaps feel better about them later.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T19:00:34-07:00","id":553620,"title":"","content":"Ok, now that I've had a moment, I just want to say <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">this is embarrassing, but the Vampire Princess Myu/Paranoia Agen/xxxHolict angle is actually an interesting alternative modus operandi, and gives the Beasts something to do, and a reason to do the other horrible things they do, when not hanging around other Supernaturals.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T19:02:23-07:00","id":553621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=553620#post553620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, now that I've had a moment, I just want to say this is embarrassing, but the Vampire Princess Myu/Paranoia Agen/xxxHolict angle is actually an interesting alternative modus operandi, and gives the Beasts something to do, and a reason to do the other horrible things they do, when not 