e":"2015-06-19T15:29:50-07:00","id":561278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=561229#post561229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which would raise the question: what would be the easiest way to do that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Folgers in their cup?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T18:31:31-07:00","id":561459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=561016#post561016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Heroes might dream of grand climactic battles in the Lair, but when push comes to shove, <b>they\u2019ll settle for a shotgun blast or an IED in the Beast\u2019s doorway. Despite the Hero\u2019s grandiose dreams, what he really wants is to see the Beast dead.</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Strip down the layers of a Hero\u2019s ego, and all one finds is murder. <b>Murder is his only end, regardless of bystanders. He\u2019ll bloviate about the innocents he saves, but at the best of times, protecting the innocent is incidental.</b> He pursues the Beast because his dreams are the surface of the Primordial Dream, and he sees monsters below. He pursues the Beast because <i>he cannot wake up.</i>&quot;</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Hero the Reckoning: Wayward","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T06:36:55-07:00","id":561838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kickstarter</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">If we pass </span></span></span><b>$96,000 </b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">of contributions, we will continue the creation of a </span></span></span><b>Beast: the Primordial </b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">fiction anthology with two more short stories that further explore the characters and stories possible with </span></span></span><b>Beast</b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">. The PDF and electronic versions of the anthology will be sent to every backer who pledged for a Reward Tier that includes a PDF of </span></span></span><b>Beast: The Primordial</b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>So I'm guessing there will be another goal 102k (please Vancouver city book), another addition to the fiction anthology at 105k, and then the Interface for the anthology at 108k.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"