 was nofather arguing with everyone about Heroes: y'all need to stop feeding this vast echoing pit.<br /> <br /> Rater's clearly made up his mind and, while it would be fantastic if he would take the lesson that since the game is not going to be to his liking he'd probably be better off not posting in its primary discussion thread, Mother always said &quot;don't pick at it.&quot; Use your Ignore Lists if you need to, but <i>please</i> don't keep cluttering the place up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:35:14-07:00","id":564564,"title":"","content":"I was arguing with one person, thank you. And only trying to point out that Beasts were responsible for the creation of Heroes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:35:41-07:00","id":564566,"title":"","content":"If complaints are not heard, then revision is just trading crap for crap.<br /> <br /> Many of the revisions, especially to fluff, are only hurting the game by changing it from the game that was promised.<br /> <br /> It's not like I'm screaming about problems that aren't there. These are valid criticisms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:38:45-07:00","id":564568,"title":"","content":"They're <i>both </i>you. A nascent beast has a horror and a soul, or rather a soul has both a horror and a nascent beast. It's a barrier, the last lingering thread of humanity, constantly harried by the horror connected to it.<br /> <br /> When the devouring happens, your soul, the thing separating you and the horror collapses and both your mind and the horror are pulled into the void left behind and fuse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:44:18-07:00","id":564591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <