 thread of humanity, constantly harried by the horror connected to it.<br /> <br /> When the devouring happens, your soul, the thing separating you and the horror collapses and both your mind and the horror are pulled into the void left behind and fuse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Citation needed.<br /> <br /> A Nascent beat is an otherwise ordenary person who just so happens to be having dreams about the primordial dream.<br /> <br /> Then the meet a Beast, who goes into their dreams, eats there soul, and makes way for a horror that was either created at this moment or was a separate entity that existed already, and either way was not part of you, to move into the place where the soul used to be.<br /> <br /> It was not part of you until after the devouring. That's what I read.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:46:35-07:00","id":564593,"title":"","content":"An easy solution Rater might find would just be to use the original version of the text, since they thought it was best, and it's still available. To shore up missing information from it, such as about the Primordial, they could just use the new info, since it wouldn't really infringe on the setting the first edition established regarding what Beasts are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:47:34-07:00","id":564594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/229044-beast-the-primordial?p=564591#post564591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not really Rater you're really not.</div> </div> </div> </div>Explain that please.<br /> <br /> Am I not screaming about problems that don't exist?<br /> <br /> Or am I not making valid criticism?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T14:50:08-07:00","id":564598,"title":"","content":"<div c